{"id":"vod_sn_38456","vodId":"38456","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"约定的梦幻岛第一季","name_cn":"约定的梦幻岛第一季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e63f2efe0d4302f025ebf0ba0e93da26.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为恩典农场的孤儿院内，在这里生活着很多失去了亲人，无家可归的孩子们，他们共有36人，每天，在劳作和玩耍之余，孩子们还要进行学习和测验，其中，佼佼者是名为艾玛（诸星堇 配音）的女孩和名为诺曼（内田真礼 配音）的男孩。负责管理和看护这些孩子们的女性名叫伊莎贝拉（甲斐田裕子 配音），孩子们喜欢喊她“妈妈”。每过一段时间，都会有一个孩子被收养离开农场，生活在这里的孩子们都将此作为自己的人生目标。　　一次偶然中，艾玛发现了隐藏在这座孤儿院背后的秘密，那些离开的孩子根本就没有被领养，而是被屠宰了，生活在恩典农场的孩子们，其实就是这座农场所饲养的“牲畜”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7qfma0aYc21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aDiAxb2i5B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3kWLTS5RWR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2zuYWdt1Nf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F4Um2xJpzq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bPAuTyL2ND1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7A89nx2PVU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/20TeJmw2kD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rjED6vpZV11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yfc28kf94P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/115SLXPftV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/44fu5QCrih1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.563Z"}